# khci / quip fixture: He3 chain (1.30 A) in 6-31G, localized orbitals of one SCF; with the
# other orbital set it gates the rotated representation (internal/adc/quip).
# Regenerate: OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 python scripts/fcidump/dump_fcidump.py --input testdata/khci/he3chain_631g_localized.in
&geometry
  file   he3_chain.xyz
  unit   angstrom
&basis
  name   6-31g
&scf
  charge 0
  spin   0
  symmetry off
  max_cycle 200
&orbitals
  scheme        localized
  compact_basis 6-31g
  lindep        1e-6
&output
  fcidump  he3chain_631g_localized.fcidump
  sidecar  he3chain_631g_localized.mo.json
  manifest he3chain_631g_localized.ref.json
